spice
* Differential amplifier circuit

* Voltage Sources
VDD 5 0 DC VDD_VALUE

* Resistors
RD1 2 5 RD_VALUE
RD2 6 5 RD_VALUE

* Transistors
M1 2 1 3 3 NMOS_MODEL
M2 6 1 3 3 NMOS_MODEL

* Current Source
ISS 3 4 DC ISS_VALUE

* Capacitor
C1 4 0 C1_VALUE

* Connectors for Output
Vout1 2 0
Vout2 6 0

* Define Model Parameters
.model NMOS_MODEL NMOS(...)

*.END